//! Manual broad comparison of the beam-width-one combat resolver and production Oracle.
//!
//! Run with:
//! `cargo test -p mk-engine --release greedy_vs_oracle_broad_diagnostic -- --ignored --nocapture`
//!
//! Replay artifacts generated by `generate_replays.py --artifact` contain filtered
//! client states rather than lossless `GameState` snapshots. Their observed enemy/hand
//! combinations inform these fixtures, but every case is constructed as a valid engine
//! state so both resolvers receive identical hidden state and legal actions.

